  "description": "Real-time policy guard for autonomous agents. One line to wrap your agent: every action is evaluated against your plain-language policies before it executes.",
  "keywords": ["ai-agents", "guardrails", "policy-engine", "llm-safety", "autonomous-agents", "eu-ai-act", "audit-trail"],
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
